{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261123/photo/bkn-20261123052212886-1123_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261123071701\"/><p>水柱激射約10米高。</p><p>荃灣有地底鹹水管爆裂。今日(23日)清晨5時，有途人報案，指大壩街23至25號對開行人路有地底有水管爆裂，水柱激射約10米高，並射向鄰近商舖，路面出現約3呎乘3呎下陷。</p><p>警員接報到場封閉部分路段，相關部門人員經了解後確定地底一條鹹水管爆裂，工人隨即閂水掣進行搶修。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T23:24:11.846944+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T21:22:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T01:17:29.327593+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T23:17:40.896826+00:00","content_hash":"f56618131515a85e35889cb354aed6c235c68269feed3a849f58bfc9ad63f85e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}